<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/5/eng@/~cl_73__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after paragraph (h) the following paragraphs: “(i) regulating wildlife competitions and wildlife control services; and (j) regulating the use of any wildlife in the performance of any religious, customs or cultural activities.”. New Schedules"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/5/eng@> .
