<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/5/eng@/~cl_9> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal Act is amended by inserting after section 25 the following section: “Altering, etc., licence, permit or special permit 25a. (1) No person shall— (a) alter, forge, mutilate or deface any licence, permit or special permit; or (b) knowingly use any licence, permit or special permit which has been so altered, forged, mutilated or defaced. (2) Any person who contravenes subsection (1) commits an offence and shall, on conviction— (a) where such person is an individual, be liable to a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding seven years or to both; or (b) where such person is a body corporate, be liable to a fine not exceeding two hundred thousand ringgit.”. Amendment of section 28"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/5/eng@> .
